Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLhXsOcsqnLuvvqfUZSAANQqczZHdC8E_buzGr8GW-AyQ&oe=6A9C2E2C"}, {"file_name": "5_2560x1440.png", "id": "1376943757657880", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314660_1376943760991213_6374400558414222469_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qpCBTV_TRdwQ7kNvwHUFOdS&_nc_oc=Adp1V1qkflJQiUSeXk7azM2WrE-tqrJeIToRsmYvsnZ-ocUVpmD_XuHGOEypxMIdjKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK23JF2VfMTAJVu0R0hZ29PSKtPm3T4HnrTaAkOBfUy7A&oe=6A9C2131"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape.png", "id": "983984550317506", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391797_983984553650839_8636229960987018933_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-wR6jgxD6GYQ7kNvwH_ZK_B&_nc_oc=Adpk8K95MyTYHI-OjQokqOej4_JeMU4rv7R6q3W4fJqTObjrLwum8GI8lRIUEdG5BYA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIW8Kv6noG4KCIi7LYlcL97HWejXZddUyhAQfao-EU4Bg&oe=6A9C20CD"}, "display_name": "Ship Battles", "keywords": ["board", "naval", "pirates", "battleship", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "**Bring the classic battleship-inspired board game to life on your real table.** This naval strategy game in Mixed Reality offers an intuitive experience for players of all skill levels.\n\nPlace your fleet, aim your cannon by hand, and fire to sink the enemy ships before they sink yours. Outsmart your opponent and command the high seas in a game that balances calm decision-making with strategic depth, where every shot counts.\n\n**Three ways to play**\n- **Solo campaign**: sail through a story-driven adventure of escalating naval duels.\n- **Online matchmaking**: face players from around the world.\n- **With a friend**: invite someone to a one-on-one duel.\n\n**Features**\n- Battle across boards of many shapes and sizes, from quick skirmishes to the classic 10x10 grid.\n- Command a fleet of ships, from pirate galleons to modern destroyers, submarines, and aircraft carriers.\n- A story-driven campaign where your first mate Ducky trains you from your very first shot, with surprises waiting on the high seas.\n- Earn trophies and climb the campaign map.\n- Intuitive hand and controller tracking for seamless gameplay.\n\n**Early Access**\n\nThe game is still in development, and we want your feedback. Coming soon:\n- Power-ups and special abilities that add new layers of strategy.\n- An expanding campaign with new levels, bosses, and ships.\n- New board themes and more.\n\nHelp shape the ultimate Mixed Reality naval combat experience. Your feedback is invaluable!", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a battleship-inspired naval strategy game in Mixed Reality, for players of all skill levels. Your real table becomes the battlefield.\n\nPlace your fleet, aim your cannon by hand, and fire to sink the enemy ships before they sink yours. Play solo through a story-driven campaign, match with players around the world, or invite a friend to a one-on-one duel.\n\nEasy to learn, with the strategy that makes every shot count. Rediscover the joy of naval battles!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.atomicrealm.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Atomic Realm", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.atomicrealm.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices":